isabled=\"\" />\nText.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" /> after blank?</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h1>[ ] ATX Heading</h1>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"\" checked=\"\" /> In a list in a block quote</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n","t":"htmlOptions","test":"gfm_task_list_item"}
